{"ID":"20240118151303-cy6ifo3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151303-cy6ifo3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151303-cy6ifo3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151303-vkhsorn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129165757-dew90ur\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122101317-n3bayz1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:256,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:284\u0026#125;","title":"086升麻","type":"doc","updated":"20240129165757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151303-vkhsorn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151303-vkhsorn","updated":"20240122101024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘辛，主解百毒，杀百老物殃鬼，辟温疾障邪气毒蛊，入口皆吐出，中恶腹痛，时气毒疠，头痛，寒热，风肿诸毒，喉痛口疮，久服不夭。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101028-i5ebtgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101028-i5ebtgv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产益州山谷中，今四川陕西淮南溪涧阴地皆有之，根紫黑色、体轻，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101030-oah6ind","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101030-oah6ind"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘苦，性平无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101033-g49g2xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101033-g49g2xn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】升麻为升阳散毒要药，功能升清气，散浊邪，治斑疹疮毒，时气寒热，阳明胃经风邪。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101034-us2k1n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101034-us2k1n3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】小儿惊痫，热拥不通，疗痈，豌豆疮，水煎绵沾拭疮上。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101036-2ech50l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101036-2ech50l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】安魂定魄，鬼附啼泣，疳疮游风肿毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101037-8pcv39l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101037-8pcv39l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】治阳明头痛，补脾胃，去皮肤风邪，解肌肉间风热，疗肺痿咳唾脓血，能发浮汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101039-mtvfj0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101039-mtvfj0t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【好古】牙根浮烂恶臭，太阳鼻衄，为疮家圣药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101041-l1ajq0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101041-l1ajq0j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至一钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101043-xn5aoqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101043-xn5aoqj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡吐衄多痰，阴虚火动，气逆呕吐，惊悸怔忡癫狂等病，均忌。误用多致危。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101045-4oxr83s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101045-4oxr83s"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】升麻味甘，能升脾胃之气，其能升之理则因根中有孔道，引水气上达于苗，故性主升，然无四散之性，因为是根之性，升麻根大于苗，故根之得气也厚，故专取其根。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122101046-813rl9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101046-813rl9d"}},{"ID":"20240122101046-lippld3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101046-lippld3","updated":"20240122101310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第86味药，升麻。这个是我们用的很多的一种药，升麻。各位看看，这是王不留行，这个长的样子很奇怪的，这是升麻。升麻呢，外用，涂在伤口，内服，通通可以，外用内服都可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240122101313-56vxmlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101313-56vxmlt","updated":"20240129165533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个本经的原文呢，味辛、甘、辛，解百毒，能够杀百、什么百、杀百老物啊殃鬼啊，过去因为这个民间嘛，他们比较无知，常常发那个病怎么人们很奇怪，有的人发炎、发高烧、发的很神昏谵语哦乱讲，这个中邪了，山精什么反正就是…就讲出来，这个升麻呢都能够解毒，那这个药用的很多，还有的人发…伤口嘛，伤口化脓，发高烧了，病人后来就神昏谵语哦，就开始。"}]},{"ID":"20240122101317-n3bayz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101317-n3bayz1","updated":"20240129165753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治呢，升麻是升阳散毒的要药，阳下坠能够升阳，那脸上的阳明经的风邪呢，脸上的斑点，比如说脸上的阳明经的位置，脸在这边，这个眼睛，脸、嘴巴、耳朵，阳明经在这个地方，头维下关颊车迎，承泣四白巨髎，这些位置上长了红斑，都可以用这个升麻，外敷内服都可以。过去小孩子呢，发痘疮啊什么，用升麻泡水调调水，用那个粘在伤口上都很好用的，内服的话可以安魂定魄，那过去呢牙根都烂掉了，牙龈都烂掉了，腐烂了都可以用升麻。所以升麻是一个疮家的圣药，身上生疮哦，恶疮，脓疮，牙齿牙龈的毁损，通通都可以使用升麻。解毒去热的力量非常的强，诸位记得最好的药外用内服都好，这个是最好的药，外面先涂一些，里面又再吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240129165757-dew90ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129165757-dew90ur"}}]}